{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSNavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an interactive variant of the list item that triggers an action when tapped."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It displays a navigation indicator (chevron for next\/previous, or an external link icon)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to communicate the type of navigation to the user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The item typically contains a label, and optionally a description, an overline, an extra label,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a text slot, a bottom slot, and a helper text — all provided through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can also include an optional leading element (such as an icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and an optional trailing element (such as a text, badge, tag, icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For non-interactive, display-only list items, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Indicator types","level":2,"anchor":"Indicator-types"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItemIndicatorType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the visual indicator and semantic meaning of the navigation:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".next"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (default): A forward chevron indicating in-app navigation to a next screen."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".previous"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A backward chevron indicating in-app navigation to a previous screen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".previous"},{"type":"text","text":", the leading element is automatically hidden."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".external"}]},{"type":"text","text":": An external link icon indicating that the action opens content outside the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. a URL in a browser or an external viewer)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Simple navigable list item with forward navigation","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Next screen\")","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ List item with external navigation","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Open website\"),","        indicatorType: .external","    ) {","        openURL(url)","    }","","    \/\/ List item with backward navigation","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Go back\"),","        indicatorType: .previous","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate back","    }","","    \/\/ List item with leading avatar, trailing text, and forward navigation","    let avatar = OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium)","","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"Profile\", description: \"View your profile\"),","        leading: .avatar(avatar),","        trailing: .text(.labelMuted(Text(\"Details\")))","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to profile","    }","","    \/\/ List item with a custom view as trailing, e.g. a gauge showing a remaining SMS credit","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"SMS credit\"),","        trailing: .custom {","            OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","        }","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to SMS credit details","    }","","    \/\/ List item with slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(","            label: \"Settings\",","            textSlot: { Text(\"Configure options\") },","            helperText: \"Helper text\"","        )","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to settings","    }","","    \/\/ List item with bottomSlot (displayed under main content, before helper text)","    OUDSNavigationListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(","            label: \"Profile\",","            bottomSlot: { Text(\"Additional info\") },","            helperText: \"Helper text\"","        )","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to profile","    }"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Leading elements","level":2,"anchor":"Leading-elements"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The leading position (before the texts) accepts one optional element via "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemLeading","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".icon(OUDSListItemIcon)"},{"type":"text","text":": A status or custom icon (neutral, info, warning, negative, positive)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".image(OUDSListItemImage)"},{"type":"text","text":": A static image asset"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".flag(OUDSListItemFlag)"},{"type":"text","text":": A country flag image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".avatar(OUDSListItemAvatar)"},{"type":"text","text":": An avatar with icon, initials, or image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".custom { ... }"},{"type":"text","text":": Any custom SwiftUI view (e.g. a gauge)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Trailing elements","level":2,"anchor":"Trailing-elements"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The trailing position (after the texts) accepts one optional element via "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemTrailing","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", like:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".text(.label(String))"},{"type":"text","text":": A default-styled label"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".text(.labelMuted(String))"},{"type":"text","text":": A muted (secondary) label"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".text(.labelStrong(String))"},{"type":"text","text":": An emphasized (bold) label"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".text(.labelAndExtraLabel(String, String))"},{"type":"text","text":": A label with an additional e